body": "Hello! My friend really loves your art and she asked me to send the request on her behalf.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/222jshza6tdf\nThis is her character!\n\nPlease make her super cute! Please draw her holding a large daisy like in the reference!\nShe is a teddy bear living in a cute store trying to bring happiness to people.\n\nMy friend is a vtuber who streams on twitch, so your art may appear on her SNS.\nShe will always provide credit when used.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}